{"sun_chen_and_lee_s_alternative_approach__updates__the_activation_of_a_recurrent_unit_by_adding_the_old_activation_and_the_scaled_current_net_input": "The predicate \"updates\" refers to the process by which Sun, Chen, and Lee\u2019s alternative approach modifies the activation of a recurrent unit. This is done by incorporating both the old activation and the scaled current net input, aiming to improve the handling of long time lags in neural networks."},
