{"simple_weight_guessing__solves_problems__faster_than_the_algorithms_these_authors_proposed": "The predicate \"solves problems\" indicates that Simple Weight Guessing is capable of addressing and resolving issues or challenges that are presented in certain contexts, specifically those related to the classification of training sequences in neural networks."},
