{"each_memory_cell__built_around__central_linear_unit_with_a_fixed_self_connection_the_cec": "The phrase 'built around' indicates that the central linear unit with a fixed self-connection serves as the core component or foundational element upon which each memory cell is constructed and operates."},
{"central_linear_unit_with_a_fixed_self_connection_the_cec": "The central linear unit with a fixed self-connection (the CEC) is a fundamental component within each memory cell. It is characterized by its self-connected nature, which allows for constant error flow and plays a crucial role in the memory cell's operation."},
