{"memory_cell_cj": "Memory cell _cj_ is a component in a system that has a self-recurrent connection with a weight of 1.0, providing feedback with a delay of one time step. It is integral to the CEC (Cellular Encoding Circuit) system.|Here is another description: The memory cell _cj_ is a component within a system that utilizes a self-recurrent connection with a weight of 1.0, providing feedback with a delay of one time step. It forms the basis of the CEC (Cellular Exponential Cell)."},
