{"input_units_gate_units_memory_cells_or_conventional_hidden_units": "Input units, gate units, memory cells, and conventional hidden units are different types of components found in neural networks. Input units receive external data, gate units control the flow of information, memory cells store information over time, and hidden units process and transform data within the network."},
{"different_types_of_units": "Different types of units refer to various components within a neural network, such as input units, gate units, memory cells, and conventional hidden units. These units play distinct roles in processing and storing information within the network."},
