{"input_gate_output_gate__to_decide__whether_to_store_access_certain_information_in_its_memory_cell": "The role of the input gate and output gate is to make decisions based on inputs from other memory cells. This decision-making process determines the subsequent actions regarding information storage and retrieval within the network."},
