{"local_in_space": "\"Local in space\" refers to a property of recurrent net algorithms where the update complexity per time step and weight is independent of the network size. This means that the computational requirements do not increase with the size of the network.|Here is another description: \"Local in space\" refers to a property of recurrent net algorithms where the update complexity per time step and weight is independent of the network size. This means that the computational requirements for updating weights do not increase with the size of the network."},
