{"bias_the_input_gate_inj_toward_zero": "Biasing the input gate _inj_ toward zero is a technique used to mitigate drift problems. This involves adjusting the initial bias of the input gate to a value closer to zero, which helps in stabilizing the learning process and reducing the impact of drift."},
