{"solutions_to_most_of_our_tasks__are__sparse_in_weight_space": "The predicate 'are' serves as a linking verb that connects the subject (solutions to most of our tasks) with its characteristic or state (sparse in weight space), indicating the nature of these solutions within the context of the tasks described."},
