{"the_right_most_column": "The right-most column refers to a specific section in a table or chart that presents data related to the performance or requirements of different machine learning models, particularly focusing on LSTM in this context.|Here is another description: The right-most column refers to a specific section in a table or dataset that provides particular information about the performance of a sequence training process.|Here is another description: The right-most column in the context refers to a specific section of a table or data presentation that provides critical information about the experimental setup or results.|Here is another description: The right-most column in the context refers to a specific section of a table or data presentation that provides critical information about the experimental setup or results."},
