{"task_3c": "Task 3c is a complex machine learning task that builds upon the architecture and parameters of Task 3a. It involves classifying inputs into two classes with specific target values (0.2 and 0.8) amidst Gaussian noise. The task requires the system to learn conditional expectations of targets given inputs, achieve high weight precision, and minimize mean squared error."},
