{"positive_negative_internal_state": "The positive (negative) internal state refers to the condition of a system where the internal state is either enhanced or diminished based on the feedback loop within the system. In the context of neural networks, it describes how certain inputs can lead to an increase or decrease in the internal state of a memory cell."},
