{"2b__differ_slightly_from__those_of_the_other_more_systematic_experiments": "The predicate 'differ slightly from' indicates a minor variation or discrepancy between the subject and the object of the triple. This suggests that while there are similarities, there are also notable differences that are worth mentioning."},
