{"fahlman_s_e": "S. E. Fahlman is a researcher known for his contributions to the field of neural networks, particularly in the development of learning algorithms.|Here is another description: S. E. Fahlman is a researcher known for his work in neural networks, particularly for developing the cascade-correlation learning architecture, which is a method for training neural networks."},
