{"diploma_thesis": "The diploma thesis is a scholarly work that represents the culmination of academic research and study at the diploma level. It is a comprehensive document that demonstrates the subject's understanding and contribution to the field of study, in this case, dynamic neural networks.|Here is another description: The subject, \"Diploma thesis,\" refers to a scholarly work completed by a student as part of their academic program, typically involving original research or a comprehensive study on a specific topic."},
