{"hochreiter_s": "Hochreiter, S. is a researcher known for his work in the field of neural networks, particularly for his contributions to the development of the Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) model. He has authored and co-authored several influential papers in the domain of recurrent neural networks and their applications."},
