{"hochreiter_s_schmidhuber_j__published__long_short_term_memory_tech_rep_no_fki_207_95": "The predicate \"published\" indicates that the subject, Hochreiter, S. & Schmidhuber, J., released or made publicly available their work on Long short-term memory."},
{"long_short_term_memory_tech_rep_no_fki_207_95": "Long short-term memory (Tech. Rep. No. FKI-207-95) is a technical report authored by Hochreiter, S. & Schmidhuber, J., which introduces the concept of Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) networks, a type of recurrent neural network designed to address the vanishing gradient problem and improve the learning of long-term dependencies."},
