{"learning_sequential_structures_with_the_realtime_recurrent_learning_algorithm_international_journal_of_neural_systems_1_2_125_131": "\"Learning sequential structures with the realtime recurrent learning algorithm. International Journal of Neural Systems, 1 (2), 125\u2013131.\" is the title of the paper published by Smith and Zipser in the International Journal of Neural Systems, which discusses the application of a real-time recurrent learning algorithm to learn sequential structures."},
{"sun_g_chen_h_lee_y": "Sun, G., Chen, H., & Lee, Y. are authors who contributed to the field of neural networks, specifically focusing on time warping invariant neural networks."},
