{"a_mixture_of_time_delay_neural_networks_and_time_constants": "A mixture of time-delay neural networks and time constants refers to a hybrid approach that combines elements of time-delay neural networks, which incorporate delays in the processing of inputs, with the concept of time constants, which influence the rate of change in unit activations to manage long time lags effectively."},
