{"ring_s_network__adds__a_higher_order_unit_influencing_appropriate_connections_whenever_a_unit_receives_conflicting_error_signals": "The predicate \"adds\" in this context refers to the action taken by Ring's network when it encounters conflicting error signals. This action involves incorporating new elements into the network to manage and resolve these conflicts effectively."},
