{"bengio_and_frasconi": "Bengio and Frasconi are researchers who have contributed to the field of machine learning, particularly in the context of optimization methods and error propagation techniques. Their work is noted for investigating various methods to solve complex problems, such as those involving time lags and continuous problems."},
