{"the_error_flow_from_unit_j_s_output": "The error flow from unit _j_\u2019s output represents the signals that are generated as a result of discrepancies between the predicted and actual outputs in a neural network. These error signals are critical for the backpropagation process, which adjusts the weights of the network to minimize errors and improve accuracy. The control exerted by _outj_ over this flow is essential for maintaining the integrity of the learning process and preventing weight conflicts."},
