{"logistic_activation_function_sigmoid_in_0_1": "The logistic activation function sigmoid in [0, 1] is a mathematical function used in neural networks to introduce non-linearity. It maps any real-valued number into a value between 0 and 1, which is crucial for the network to learn complex patterns."},
