{"hidden_unit__is_replaced_by__memory_cell_and_input_gate": "The phrase \"is replaced by\" indicates a substitution or an upgrade in the architecture of a neural network, where one component is swapped out for another to improve performance or functionality."},
{"memory_cell_and_input_gate": "The memory cell and input gate are components of an LSTM (Long Short-Term Memory) network. The memory cell stores information over time, while the input gate controls the flow of new information into the memory cell, allowing the network to better handle sequential data.|Here is another description: The memory cell and input gate are components of a Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) network, which is a type of recurrent neural network designed to learn order dependence in sequence prediction problems."},
