{"neural_sequence_chunker_and_lstm": "The neural sequence chunker and LSTM are advanced neural network architectures designed to handle sequential data. The neural sequence chunker breaks down sequences into manageable chunks, while LSTM (Long Short-Term Memory) networks are a type of recurrent neural network capable of learning order dependence in sequence prediction problems."},
