{"one_third_of_all_trials_with_p_100": "\"One-third of all trials with p = 100\" describes the specific condition under which the two-net sequence chunker was tested. Here, p = 100 likely refers to a parameter setting within the trials, possibly indicating the length or complexity of the sequences being processed. The two-net sequence chunker managed to solve the task in only one-third of these trials, showing a moderate success rate under these particular conditions."},
