{"p_100": "The object \"p = 100\" refers to a specific condition or parameter setting in the experimental context, where p likely represents a time lag or delay parameter. This setting challenges the LSTM's ability to process and learn from sequences with long dependencies, demonstrating its capability to handle complex temporal dynamics."},
