{"chunker_learning_to_predict_the_final_element_correctly": "The object \"chunker learning to predict the final element correctly\" describes a specific outcome or goal within task 2a. It involves a chunker, which is likely a component of a machine learning model designed to segment or parse data into meaningful chunks. The goal is for this chunker to accurately predict the final element in a sequence, indicating a successful completion of the task."},
